{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/des0_slogan.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1_RIVALS_GIF_3_Wishlist_600x200.gif?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/des1_v2.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the galaxy's most skilled pilot! Shoot and ride your way through team fights in arenas all over the solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/2_RIVALS_GIF_2_Action_600x200.gif?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/des2_v2.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slide towards your opponents and give them a taste of your pulse guns. Ride, grind, and collide across the arena! Outwit your foes with agile drifts and daring jumps. Give them hell with precision braking and explosive boosters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/3_RIVALS_GIF_5_Customisation_600x200.gif?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/des3.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movement is power in this universe. And with a Hover Vehicle, that power can be yours! Show everyone who's boss by customizing your vehicle's design. Imagine controlling this radiant machine as it glides under the stars across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/4_RIVALS_GIF_1_Garage_600x200.gif?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/des4.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a variety of vehicles from various manufacturers, each boosting unique abilities. Quickly outmaneuver opponents, withstand heavy fire to shield teammates, or support your team by repairing damage and impairing adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/des5.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Initiate the &quot;Add to Wishlist&quot; process and await further instructions.  We'll send out the call once your vehicle is ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/5_RIVALS_GIF_4_Discord_600x200.gif?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/des6.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hover, boost and shoot your way to the top! Dominate everything between you and the ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/EF_GAMES_Team_NEW.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/des7.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafting Rivals Hover League from the vibrant heart of Madrid with meticulous detail and polished gameplay. We want our players to have FUN and discover new ways to master the arenas. We're looking for pilots like you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3251280?t=1744920008","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/f21190956efa2151a159b60065aaa6f84432b419/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744920008","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/1221223d3ca3a51bfafacaf51d9583d6653468bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744920008","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/1221223d3ca3a51bfafacaf51d9583d6653468bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744920008","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>BE PART OF OUR COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/2504_Rivals_Discord_Promo_Banner_1633265785_600x200_F.png?t=1744920008\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/des0_slogan.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1_RIVALS_GIF_3_Wishlist_600x200.gif?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/des1_v2.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the galaxy'