upport your team by repairing damage and impairing adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/des5.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Initiate the &quot;Add to Wishlist&quot; process and await further instructions.  We'll send out the call once your vehicle is ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/5_RIVALS_GIF_4_Discord_600x200.gif?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/des6.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hover, boost and shoot your way to the top! Dominate everything between you and the ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/EF_GAMES_Team_NEW.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/des7.png?t=1744920008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafting Rivals Hover League from the vibrant heart of Madrid with meticulous detail and polished gameplay. We want our players to have FUN and discover new ways to master the arenas. We're looking for pilots like you!</p>","developers":["EF Games"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Krafton ID (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/8c094d4f89f0bc920a411d44c7ba851679f7802b/header.jpg?t=1744920008","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 EF Games. RIVALS HOV